SUMMARY:🍻 Oktoberfest at ZincHouse | Live Music & New Friends
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nLet’s give Sunday afternoon a litt
 le Oktoberfest energy. 🍻\n\nJoin us at ZincHouse for seasonal beer\, fo
 od trucks\, live music\, and an afternoon hanging out with new friends. Wi
 th terraces overlooking the grounds and a courtyard built for lingering\, 
 we’ve got a pretty great setting for a Sunday escape.\n\nCome solo or br
 ing a friend! We’ll meet up\, make introductions\, grab something to dri
 nk\, and enjoy the afternoon together.\n\nWHAT’S HAPPENING\n🎶 Live mu
 sic from Van Meter\n🍺 Seasonal beer feature\n🌮 Food trucks\n🛍️ 
 Vendors to browse\n🤝 A relaxed group hang—no need to know anyone befo
 rehand\n\nWHEN & WHERE\n📅 Sunday\, September 27\, 2026\n🕑 Our meetup
 : 2–5 PM\n🎉 Full festival: Noon–8 PM\n📍 ZincHouse Winery & Brewe
 ry\n6225 Wake Forest Hwy\, Durham\, NC\n\nPlan to purchase your own food a
 nd drinks. We’re joining ZincHouse’s public event together.\n\nFINDING
  US\nCheck the Meetup comments for group coordination and our meeting spot
  when you arrive.\n\nRSVP so we know who’s coming—and let’s raise a 
 glass to new friends. Prost! 🍻
