SUMMARY:Romance Book Club: If I Never Met You
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nOur next book is\, “If I Never Met
  You” by Mhairi McFarlane.\n\nCome meet us at Namu and have some good fo
 od\, drinks\, and chat about the book.\n\nI’ll arrive early and will try
  to grab a table for us. Most likely it will be right outside the cafe are
 a.
