SUMMARY:Spill the Tea: An LGBTQ+ Spooky Season Mixer (20s-30s) 👻🌈
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nSpooky season is here\, and we’re 
 brewing up something a little different. 👻\n\nJoin Triangle Third Place
  and Discover Durham Together at Drink a Bull in Durham for an LGBTQ+ mixe
 r filled with tea\, cocktails\, mocktails\, new connections\, and just eno
 ugh Halloween chaos.\n\nCome in costume\, add a little spooky flair\, or j
 ust show up as yourself... there is no requirement.\n\n🧪 Potion Pairing
 \n\nWhen you arrive\, you’ll receive half of a mysterious potion pairing
 . Somewhere in the room\, another person has your match. Find them\, intro
 duce yourselves\, and claim a jelly bracelet for completing each pairing.\
 n\nThen grab another "potion" and do it again.\n\nCollect bracelets throug
 hout the night as you meet new people\, with absolutely no pressure for th
 ose connections to be romantic. Friendship\, community\, flirting\, networ
 king\, finding your future karaoke duo… it all counts.\n\nIf you have a 
 sleeve of bracelets by the end of the night\, just know you're a winner an
 d better than everyone else.\n\n☕ Spill the Tea\n\nWho doesn't like some
  Tea? We’ll also have an anonymous Spill the Tea jar circulating through
 out the evening.\n\nDrop in a confession\, unpopular opinion\, ridiculous 
 dating story\, queer awakening\, Halloween hot take\, or harmless secret. 
 Throughout the night\, we’ll pull a few out and expose them.\n\nNo names
 . No judgment. Potentially a little chaos.\n\n🐂 Drink a Bull\n\nDrink a
  Bull serves both specialty teas and alcoholic beverages\, so whether your
  potion of choice is boozy\, caffeinated\, or completely alcohol-free\, th
 ere’s something for you.\n\nCome meet people. Collect some bracelets. Sp
 ill a little tea. Maybe cast a spell or two.\n\n🌈 LGBTQ+ community memb
 ers and allies are welcome. Registered attendees only.
