SUMMARY:Romance Book Club: Practical Magic
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nIt’s almost Halloween so I thought
  it would be fun to have a themed book for the vibes.\n\nWe will be readin
 g\, “Practical Magic” by Alice Hoffman.\n\nCome join us at Namu for so
 me good food\, drinks\, and chat about the book.\n\nI’ll arrive early an
 d get us a table. More than likely it will be one of the three tables righ
 t outside the Cafe area.
